# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback. Pages Functions (/api/*) and real static files
# are matched BEFORE this rule, so the API is never shadowed; everything else
# serves the app shell so client-side hash/routing works on hard refresh.
# (Ignored by GitHub Pages, which uses 404.html — harmless to ship in dist/.)
/api/*  /api/:splat  200
/*      /index.html  200
